ers.<br>Usually, there are 10 to 30 times more clients on the free servers than on the PRO servers. If the number of connections increases, we will add a new server. The free servers are great to use, but sometimes it happens that one of the servers is too busy, in this case, you need to connect to another one or try the PRO for free for 7 days.<br> <br>If something doesn&#39;t work, then don&#39;t be in a hurry to give it 1 star. Try to choose a different server or contact us and we will try to help you.<br> <br>You can also email us at support@tap2free.net if you need a PRO server in a new location.<br> <br>Custom Terms and Conditions:<br>By downloading and/or using this product, you acknowledge and agree to our privacy policy: http://tap2free.net/privacy-usa/Privacy-Policy-of-USA-VPN-by-tap2free.html",
